ce</b><br /> Because why argue if the outcome is alreadey determined?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T11:31:05-08:00","id":56245,"title":"","content":"<b>Insidious Fallacy Infection</b><br /> <br /> The ever-hungry, gaping maw of Oblivion silently mocks the attempts of the mortal men to understand the reality around them. This charm attempts to take a rational belief held by the victim and force her to argue for it using logical fallacies, which the Deathknight then mercilessly rebukes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/186-morty","name":"Morty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar186_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T11:42:15-08:00","id":56253,"title":"","content":"<b>&quot;I Just Want to Be Free&quot; Denial Prana</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Chaka wrote:<br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1224-drakhan-valane","name":"Drakhan Valane","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1224_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T12:27:41-08:00","id":56285,"title":"","content":"<div c